porary Heinkel He 111 and Junkers Ju 88, and although it was designed as an heavy bomber it took on many roles. The Dornier DO 217 was operated as a strategic bomber, torpedo bomber and reconnaissance aircraft, and later in the war as night fighters, but did not perform particularly well in that role. In total 1,905 were been built, including variants.","LocalizedString":"The Dornier DO 217 was a German heavy bomber used by the Luftwaffe during WWII.  The aircraft was designed in 1938 to replace the Dornier Do 17 and first saw combat in late 1940. Early variants had greater speed, range and bomb load capacity than the contemporary Heinkel He 111 and Junkers Ju 88, and although it was designed as an heavy bomber it took on many roles. The Dornier DO 217 was operated as a strategic bomber, torpedo bomber and reconnaissance aircraft, and later in the war as night fighters, but did not perform particularly well in that role. In total 1,905 were been built, including variants."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDestroyed"],"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'au_aircraft_large'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Explosions_SFX/Cues/au_aircraft_large.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/t_dornier_do_217.t_dornier_do_217","SubPathString":""},"artist":"War Picture Library / Rebellion","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/DORNIER_DO_217.DORNIER_DO_217","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":308.0},"historyPhotoSource":"U.S. Navy Naval Aviation News 15 July 1943","historyPhotoAuthor":"U.S. Navy","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_dornier_do_217_photo","SourceString":"Dornier Do 217E-2 bomber, ca 1942","LocalizedString":"Dornier Do 217E-2 bomber, ca 1942"},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key